{"ticker":"FIS","updated":"2026-11-12T23:23:40Z","profile":{"longName":"Fidelity National Information Services, Inc.","shortName":"Fidelity National Information S","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.fisglobal.com","fullTimeEmployees":44000,"marketCap":14618736640,"trailingPE":4.239163,"forwardPE":5.1802588,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.129907,"pegRatio":0.18,"targetMeanPrice":35.54545,"targetHighPrice":61.0,"targetLowPrice":25.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.271,"earningsGrowth":0.38,"grossMargins":0.35731998,"operatingMargins":0.21464,"profitMargins":0.26774,"totalRevenue":12938000384,"beta":0.853,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":68.37,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":27.93,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":5.83},"summary":"Fidelity National Information Services, Inc. provides solutions to financial institutions, businesses, and developers worldwide. The company operates through Banking Solutions, Capital Market Solutions, and Corporate and Other segments. It provides core processing and ancillary applications; mobile and online banking; fraud, risk management, and compliance; card and retail payment; electronic funds transfer and network; wealth and retirement; and item processing and output solutions. The company also offers trading and assets, lending, leveraged and syndicated loan markets, and treasury and risk solutions. Fidelity National Information Services, Inc. was founded in 1968 and is headquartered in Jacksonville, Florida.","summary_zh":"Fidelity National Information Services, Inc. 為全球金融機構、企業和開發人員提供解決方案。該公司透過銀行解決方案、資本市場解決方案以及企業和其他部門運作。提供核心處理和輔助應用；行動和網路銀行；詐欺、風險管理和合規；卡片和零售支付；電子資金轉帳和網路；財富和退休；以及物品處理和輸出解決方案。該公司還提供交易和資產、貸款、槓桿和銀團貸款市場以及財務和風險解決方案。富達國家資訊服務公司成立於 1968 年，總部位於佛羅裡達州傑克遜維爾。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"資訊科技服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":67.27,"h":67.43,"l":66.52,"c":66.93,"v":5085100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":66